// q1: does Orbit depend, directly or transitively, on Vault?
path("Orbit", "Vault")?

// q2: is a declared literal reachable as a path endpoint? (it must not be)
path("Orbit", "2031-02-01")?

// q3: how many distinct things does Orbit depend on?
count("Orbit", "depends_on")?

// q4: who owns Beacon? relation/3 holds the surface form the fact was stated
// with, so the query names owned_by, not the canonical maintained_by.
relation("Beacon", "owned_by", "Cyra")?

// q5: which entities did the policy flag?
conflict(X, Y)?
